          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. The figure shows a path (the shaded portion) laid around a rectangular park EFGH."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.131,
            0.634,
            0.244
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) What measurements do you need to find the area of the path? Once you identify the lengths to be measured, assign possible values of your choice to these measurements and find the area of the path. Give a formula for the area."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.645,
